// notchbud — native app icon (the cat logo).
// Compiled by build.rs with the Windows SDK rc.exe into app.res,
// which is passed straight to link.exe. Group icon ID 1 — the Rust
// side loads it via LoadImageW(MAKEINTRESOURCEW(1)) for the taskbar
// button and the tray icon.
1 ICON "notchbud.ico"
